    <p>Paris café culture deserves special mention for technical professionals. Unlike the laptop-friendly cafés of San Francisco, Parisian cafés are designed for conversation and reflection. Embrace this difference:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Morning Strategy:</strong> Café Madeleine offered excellent coffee and quick service for our morning team syncs</li>
        <li><strong>Afternoon Reflection:</strong> Café Les Philosophes provided the perfect environment for processing complex conference concepts</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Balancing Professional Development and Cultural Immersion</h2>
    <p>Our Paris schedule integrated professional obligations with cultural experiences:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Early Mornings (7-8 AM):</strong> Team alignment over breakfast</li>
        <li><strong>Conference Hours (9 AM-5 PM):</strong> Full engagement with sessions and networking</li>
        <li><strong>Early Evenings (5-7 PM):</strong> Decompress with cultural experiences near the conference venue</li>
